 land, both among the Chananites and the Pherezites, and I am few in number; they will gather themselves against me and cut me in pieces, and I shall be utterly destroyed, and my house."],["31",[["οἱ",709436,136],["δὲ",703303,11],["εἶπαν",705373,150],["ἀλλ᾿",700680,7],["ὡσεὶ",714159,28],["πόρνῃ",710675,1],["χρήσωνται",713937,232],["τῇ",709436,100],["ἀδελφῇ",700244,1],["ἡμῶν",705999,145]],"And they said, Nay, but shall they treat our sister as an harlot?"]]